From d8a7b8436768635c0d01b69a1951c95112d71b0a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Van Tran <trantoanvan@outlook.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 21:06:04 +0700
Subject: [PATCH] feat(properties): a select property derived from another
 (Domain from Type)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

A select property whose description says "Derived from <Source>" takes the
option named like the part of the source option before " · " (Type "Tech ·
Feature" → Domain "Tech"), when an issue is created and whenever the source
changes. Left alone when no option matches. One property to pick, the other
follows.

Patch-Id: derived-property
